==Trivia==
* Upon release, while {{TCG ID|Secluded Springs|Memory Light|68}} would allow Starly's Evolutions to use its Pluck attack, the attack would fail to remove the opponent's attached {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}}. This was identified as a bug in an in-game notice published on September 10, 2025.<ref name="MemoryLightNotices" />

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Stormfront|Starly|75}} from the {{TCG|Stormfront}} expansion.
*{{m|Pluck}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Starly}} can learn via [[TM]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

